The dish is a square plate about 22 cm across, and it holds roughly 12 chunks of honeydew melon. Each chunk is about 3 cm, so about 15-20 g each. That gives a total of about 200 g.

Honeydew has about 36 kcal per 100 g, so 200 g is about 72 kcal. The chunks may be a bit smaller than I assumed, so I'll estimate 180 g and 65 kcal.

